ps://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_Focus\" title=\"Spell Focus\"> Enchantment Focus II</a>:</b> +2 Equipment bonus to the DC of Enchantment spells.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Spell_penetration\" title=\"Spell penetration\"> Spell Penetration II</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Spell_penetration\" title=\"Spell penetration\"> Spell Penetration II</a>:</b> Passive: +2 <a href=\"/page/Equipment_bonus\" title=\"Equipment bonus\">Equipment bonus</a> to Spell Penetration checks.</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"popup has&#95;tooltip with-icon basic\"><a href=\"/page/Mind_Turbulence\" title=\"Mind Turbulence\">Mind Turbulence</a><span class=\"mw-valign-super\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Icon_tooltip.png/10px-Icon_tooltip.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"10\" height=\"8\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Icon_tooltip.png 1.5x\" /></span></span><span class=\"popup tooltip wide left below\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><b><a href=\"/page/Mind_Turbulence\" title=\"Mind Turbulence\">Mind Turbulence</a>:</b> This item fills your mind with chaos, disrupting your thoughts and causing a -10 <a href=\"/page/Concentration\" title=\"Concentration\">Concentration</a> penalty.</span></span></li></ul>\n</td>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC; vertical-align: middle;\" rowspan=\"4\" align=\"center\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/page/File:Scepter_of_Mad_Trickery.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/thumb/Scepter_of_Mad_Trickery.png/420px-Scepter_of_Mad_Trickery.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"420\" height=\"489\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://images.ddowiki.com/Scepter_of_Mad_Trickery.png 1.5x\" /></a></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Upgradeable?\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\"><i>Holding this scepter by its slippery grip, you hear voices cackling madly and a chill runs down your spine. Suddenly your thoughts are filled with ways to weave illusions that will drive your enemies to insanity.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#CF9\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#EFC\">\n<p>You can remove the <a href=\"/page/Mind_Turbulence\" title=\"Mind Turbulence\">Mind Turbulence</a> penalty with a <a href=\"/page/Sustaining_Symbiont\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Sustaining Symbiont\">Sustaining Symbiont</a>.\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817061111\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.086 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.150 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4778/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 28832/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7338/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 31/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 24/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n101.16%  132.762     49 Template:IO\n100.00%  131.242      1 